CAMBRA BRAND

# The generated blobs the pitch deck needs. All three are over jj's 1 MiB
# snapshot limit and all three are reproducible from a `cambra` checkout:
# pitch-deck/scripts/sync-cambra.sh builds the first two, which the demo slide runs
# from, and pitch-deck/scripts/build-artifact.mjs then builds the third, the
# standalone page. The program, its channel declarations and the price slice are
# small and are committed, so only these are a setup step.
pitch-deck/public/wasm/*.wasm
pitch-deck/public/inspector/index.html
pitch-deck/artifact/

# Scratch drivers — a `name.tmp.ext` is a throwaway, not something to commit.
*.tmp.*
